Copyright NVIDIA Corporation and licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

The adapted material lives in skills/isaac-sim-6/ (SKILL.md and its
references), drawn from these upstream skills:

  physics-simulation, usd-composition-architecture, isaac-sim-troubleshooting,
  isaac-sim-validator, isaac-sim-sensor, isaac-camera,
  urdf-mjcf-to-usd-conversion, usd-articulation, usd-pipeline,
  spatial-reasoning, navigation-primitives, occupancy-map,
  isaac-sim-robot-navigation, manipulation-ik, isaac-sim-rendering,
  isaac-sim-headless-deployment (batch pattern only), data-collection-sim,
  mobility-gen

All adapted content has been modified from the originals: material assuming
a local Isaac Sim installation was removed or rewritten for Antioch's remote
execution model, guidance was pinned to Isaac Sim 6.0.1, and Antioch's
lazy-import invariant was added. Customer-project-specific residue in the
upstream skills was generalized or dropped.
